1
00:00:05,184 --> 00:00:07,056
I understand her hatred

2
00:00:08,131 --> 00:00:11,456
The Fatui robbed her of the life she should have had

3
00:00:13,195 --> 00:00:15,297
I never opposed her dancing

4
00:00:16,117 --> 00:00:19,256
Yet still I became an enemy of her ballet

5
00:00:23,680 --> 00:00:25,280
I'll just keep my distance

6
00:00:25,856 --> 00:00:27,456
Many despise me

7
00:00:27,835 --> 00:00:29,056
I'm used to it

8
00:00:30,912 --> 00:00:33,856
You're certainly not one to shy away from confrontation

9
00:00:34,752 --> 00:00:37,952
But children... they need a different approach

10
00:00:39,964 --> 00:00:42,560
I'm hardly the most maternal figure...

11
00:00:44,288 --> 00:00:45,952
Yet she is a child

12
00:00:47,110 --> 00:00:48,576
In my experience

13
00:00:48,808 --> 00:00:50,880
While a "Father" commands authority

14
00:00:51,456 --> 00:00:53,426
He must still yield to love

15
00:00:54,467 --> 00:00:55,747
You should tell her

16
00:00:56,162 --> 00:00:57,904
What you think about her dancing

17
00:01:02,904 --> 00:01:06,368
Odette will soon take the stage at the Korolevskiy Theater

18
00:01:07,008 --> 00:01:08,411
This could be your chance

19
00:01:11,680 --> 00:01:14,560
Geo Gnosis secured. It went smoothly

20
00:01:15,909 --> 00:01:16,992
I'll be there

21
00:01:17,376 --> 00:01:19,363
Have them send me an invitation

22
00:01:26,656 --> 00:01:29,600
Sadly, things didn't work out

23
00:01:30,655 --> 00:01:34,272
Her final words are inside that block of ice

24
00:01:35,275 --> 00:01:39,425
This? Aren't these for monitoring her subordinates?

25
00:01:39,702 --> 00:01:40,726
Not yours

26
00:01:41,622 --> 00:01:44,182
This one isn't her "Witch's Flame"

27
00:01:44,822 --> 00:01:47,030
But my "Two Worlds' Flames"

28
00:01:47,525 --> 00:01:50,178
The "Two Worlds' Flames" can burn away memories

29
00:01:50,698 --> 00:01:53,266
It was my parting gift to Rosalyne

30
00:02:01,869 --> 00:02:03,258
If all goes to plan

31
00:02:03,258 --> 00:02:06,697
She and I will both live to see the Tsaritsa succeed

32
00:02:07,337 --> 00:02:08,934
I believe she'll find peace

33
00:02:09,769 --> 00:02:11,561
But if anything happens to me

34
00:02:12,137 --> 00:02:14,040
She needn't follow in my footsteps

35
00:02:14,633 --> 00:02:17,577
The Cryo energy will fade away in time...

36
00:02:18,400 --> 00:02:22,953
Then, the "Two Worlds' Flames" will burn away all memories of the Fatui

37
00:02:23,253 --> 00:02:25,042
She'll be free to dance

38
00:02:26,000 --> 00:02:27,525
She deserves this

39
00:02:30,419 --> 00:02:32,361
I will handle the aftermath

40
00:02:35,241 --> 00:02:38,377
The choice is yours, child

